'''Koe's''' was a [[restaurant]] on the [[planet]] [[Orondia]] at the time of the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="FAE" /> and [[Horizon Base]] at the time of the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Droid" /> An [[Aurebesh]] sign with an abstract motif, reading "EAT AT KOE'S", was used for advertisement.<ref name="FAE" /> Several decades later, Koe's was advertised on the chassis of [[R4-G77]],<ref name="Unmotivated">{{Resistance|Unmotivated}}</ref> an [[astromech droid]] owned by [[Hype Fazon]], a [[racer]] [[pilot]] on the ''[[Colossus]]'' [[Fuel|refueling]] [[Space station|station]].<ref name="Recruit">{{Resistance|The Recruit}}</ref> In addition, an advertisement for the company was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Signage at the fueling station includes: Eat at Koe's, Bounty Emporium: Always Open, Bounty Never Sleeps; Security Services; Speeder Sales; The Pilot's Lounge (Live Band Every Night); Craft Repair and Maintenance; Repair Rack Droid Services; Orondia Tours; and Meteor Cafe.|Friends and Enemies Trivia Gallery|<ref name="Trivia Gallery" />}}
Koe's was first mentioned on a sign appearing in "[[Friends and Enemies]]," the sixteenth episode of the [[The Clone Wars: Season Four|fourth season]] of ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]''.<ref name="FAE" />

